{"page":175,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:188","surah":7,"ayah":188,"ar_uthmani":"قُل لَّآ أَمْلِكُ لِنَفْسِى نَفْعًا وَلَا ضَرًّا إِلَّا مَا شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ ۚ وَلَوْ كُنتُ أَعْلَمُ ٱلْغَيْبَ لَٱسْتَكْثَرْتُ مِنَ ٱلْخَيْرِ وَمَا مَسَّنِىَ ٱلسُّوٓءُ ۚ إِنْ أَنَا۠ إِلَّا نَذِيرٌ وَبَشِيرٌ لِّقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say [Prophet], ‘I have no control over benefit or harm, [even] to myself, except as God may please: if I had knowledge of what is hidden, I would have abundant good things and no harm could touch me. I am no more than a bearer of warning, and good news to those who believe.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُل","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَّآ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمْلِكُ","en_gloss":"I have power","transliteration":"amliku","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِنَفْسِى","en_gloss":"for myself","transliteration":"linafsī","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَفْعًۭا","en_gloss":"(to) benefit","transliteration":"nafʿan","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and no","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ضَرًّا","en_gloss":"(power to) harm","transliteration":"ḍarran","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":10,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"wills","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كُنتُ","en_gloss":"I would","transliteration":"kuntu","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"aʿlamu","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْغَيْبَ","en_gloss":"(of) the unseen","transliteration":"l-ghayba","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَٱسْتَكْثَرْتُ","en_gloss":"surely I could have multiplied","transliteration":"la-is'takthartu","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْخَيْرِ","en_gloss":"the good","transliteration":"l-khayri","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مَسَّنِىَ","en_gloss":"(could) have touched me","transliteration":"massaniya","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلسُّوٓءُ ۚ","en_gloss":"the evil","transliteration":"l-sūu","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":22,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":23,"ar":"أَنَا۠","en_gloss":"(am) I","transliteration":"anā","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":24,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":25,"ar":"نَذِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"a warner","transliteration":"nadhīrun","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَبَشِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"and a bearer of good tidings","transliteration":"wabashīrun","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":27,"ar":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"to a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":28,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"who believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"7:188"},{"pos":29,"ar":"١٨٨","en_gloss":"(188)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:188"}]},{"verse_key":"7:189","surah":7,"ayah":189,"ar_uthmani":"۞ هُوَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكُم مِّن نَّفْسٍ وَٰحِدَةٍ وَجَعَلَ مِنْهَا زَوْجَهَا لِيَسْكُنَ إِلَيْهَا ۖ فَلَمَّا تَغَشَّىٰهَا حَمَلَتْ حَمْلًا خَفِيفًا فَمَرَّتْ بِهِۦ ۖ فَلَمَّآ أَثْقَلَت دَّعَوَا ٱللَّهَ رَبَّهُمَا لَئِنْ ءَاتَيْتَنَا صَـٰلِحًا لَّنَكُونَنَّ مِنَ ٱلشَّـٰكِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who created you all from one soul, and from it made its mate so that he might find comfort in her: when one [of them] lies with his wife and she conceives a light burden, going about freely, then grows heavy, they both pray to Go